        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <p key="P_regulatorysummary_0" contentType="RegulatorySummary">PThrP signall through binding to its transmembranar receptor PPR both in growth plate and adult chondrocytes. In the model PTHrP activates PPR.</p><ul key="P_regulatorysummary_0">
              <li>
